# SEO Standards for Shopify Themes

## Meta Tags and Page Titles

### Page Title Optimization
Always craft unique, descriptive titles under 60 characters with primary keywords.

**Pattern for Products:**
```liquid
<title>
  {%- if product.title -%}
    {{ product.title | strip_html | truncate: 50 }} | {{ shop.name }}
  {%- else -%}
    {{ page_title }} | {{ shop.name }}
  {%- endif -%}
</title>
```

**Pattern for Collections:**
```liquid
<title>
  {%- if collection.title -%}
    {{ collection.title | strip_html }} - {{ collection.products_count }} Products | {{ shop.name }}
  {%- else -%}
    {{ page_title }} | {{ shop.name }}
  {%- endif -%}
</title>
```

**Pattern for Blog Posts:**
```liquid
<title>
  {%- if article.title -%}
    {{ article.title | strip_html | truncate: 50 }} | {{ blog.title }} | {{ shop.name }}
  {%- else -%}
    {{ page_title }} | {{ shop.name }}
  {%- endif -%}
</title>
```

### Meta Description Implementation
Write compelling meta descriptions under 160 characters that include relevant keywords.

**Pattern for Products:**
```liquid
<meta name="description" content="
  {%- if product.description != blank -%}
    {{ product.description | strip_html | strip | truncate: 155 }}
  {%- elsif product.title -%}
    {{ product.title | strip_html }} - Available at {{ shop.name }}. {{ product.price | money }} with fast shipping.
  {%- else -%}
    {{ shop.description | default: shop.name }}
  {%- endif -%}
">
```

**Pattern for Collections:**
```liquid
<meta name="description" content="
  {%- if collection.description != blank -%}
    {{ collection.description | strip_html | strip | truncate: 155 }}
  {%- else -%}
    Shop {{ collection.title | strip_html }} at {{ shop.name }}. {{ collection.products_count }} products available with fast shipping.
  {%- endif -%}
">
```

**Check in:** `layout/theme.liquid`, `templates/*.liquid`

## Canonical URLs

### Canonical Tag Implementation
Always include canonical URLs to prevent duplicate content issues.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- if canonical_url -%}
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}">
{%- endif -%}
```

**For Paginated Collections:**
```liquid
{%- if collection.url and current_page > 1 -%}
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ collection.url }}">
{%- elsif collection.url -%}
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ collection.url }}">
{%- endif -%}
```

**For Product Variants:**
```liquid
{%- if product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}">
{%- endif -%}
```

## Open Graph and Social Media Tags

### Open Graph Implementation
Implement comprehensive Open Graph tags for social media sharing.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
<!-- Open Graph Meta Tags -->
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ shop.name }}">
<meta property="og:url" content="{{ canonical_url | default: request.origin }}{{ request.path }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="
  {%- if page_title -%}
    {{ page_title | strip_html | truncate: 60 }}
  {%- else -%}
    {{ shop.name }}
  {%- endif -%}
">
<meta property="og:type" content="
  {%- if template contains 'product' -%}product
  {%- elsif template contains 'article' -%}article
  {%- else -%}website
  {%- endif -%}
">
<meta property="og:description" content="
  {%- if product.description != blank -%}
    {{ product.description | strip_html | strip | truncate: 155 }}
  {%- elsif collection.description != blank -%}
    {{ collection.description | strip_html | strip | truncate: 155 }}
  {%- elsif article.summary != blank -%}
    {{ article.summary | strip_html | strip | truncate: 155 }}
  {%- else -%}
    {{ shop.description | default: shop.name }}
  {%- endif -%}
">
{%- if product.featured_media -%}
  <meta property="og:image" content="http:{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 1200 }}">
  <meta property="og:image:secure_url" content="https:{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 1200 }}">
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="1200">
{%- elsif collection.featured_image -%}
  <meta property="og:image" content="http:{{ collection.featured_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}">
  <meta property="og:image:secure_url" content="https:{{ collection.featured_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}">
{%- elsif article.image -%}
  <meta property="og:image" content="http:{{ article.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}">
  <meta property="og:image:secure_url" content="https:{{ article.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}">
{%- else -%}
  <meta property="og:image" content="https:{{ 'logo.png' | asset_url }}">
{%- endif -%}
```

### Twitter Cards Implementation
**Pattern:**
```liquid
<!-- Twitter Card Meta Tags -->
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="
  {%- if page_title -%}
    {{ page_title | strip_html | truncate: 60 }}
  {%- else -%}
    {{ shop.name }}
  {%- endif -%}
">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="
  {%- if product.description != blank -%}
    {{ product.description | strip_html | strip | truncate: 155 }}
  {%- elsif collection.description != blank -%}
    {{ collection.description | strip_html | strip | truncate: 155 }}
  {%- else -%}
    {{ shop.description | default: shop.name }}
  {%- endif -%}
">
{%- if product.featured_media -%}
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https:{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 1200 }}">
{%- elsif collection.featured_image -%}
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https:{{ collection.featured_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}">
{%- endif -%}
```

## Structured Data and Schema Markup

### Product Schema Implementation
Implement comprehensive product schema for rich snippets.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- if template contains 'product' -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org/",
  "@type": "Product",
  "name": {{ product.title | json }},
  "description": {{ product.description | strip_html | strip | json }},
  "url": {{ shop.url | append: product.url | json }},
  "sku": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.sku | json }},
  "gtin": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.barcode | json }},
  "brand": {
    "@type": "Brand",
    "name": {{ product.vendor | json }}
  },
  {%- if product.featured_media -%}
  "image": [
    {%- for media in product.media limit: 5 -%}
      {{ media | image_url: width: 1200 | json }}
      {%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ],
  {%- endif -%}
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "url": {{ shop.url | append: product.url | json }},
    "priceCurrency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
    "price": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | divided_by: 100.0 | json }},
    "availability": "
      {%- if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available -%}
        https://schema.org/InStock
      {%- else -%}
        https://schema.org/OutOfStock
      {%- endif -%}
    ",
    "seller": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": {{ shop.name | json }}
    }
  }
  {%- if product.metafields.reviews.rating.value -%}
  ,
  "aggregateRating": {
    "@type": "AggregateRating",
    "ratingValue": {{ product.metafields.reviews.rating.value }},
    "reviewCount": {{ product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value | default: 1 }}
  }
  {%- endif -%}
}
</script>
{%- endif -%}
```

### Organization Schema
**Pattern:**
```liquid
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Organization",
  "name": {{ shop.name | json }},
  "url": {{ shop.url | json }},
  {%- if shop.description -%}
  "description": {{ shop.description | json }},
  {%- endif -%}
  "logo": {
    "@type": "ImageObject",
    "url": {{ 'logo.png' | asset_url | json }}
  },
  "sameAs": [
    {%- if settings.social_facebook_link != blank -%}
      {{ settings.social_facebook_link | json }}
      {%- if settings.social_instagram_link != blank or settings.social_twitter_link != blank -%},{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if settings.social_instagram_link != blank -%}
      {{ settings.social_instagram_link | json }}
      {%- if settings.social_twitter_link != blank -%},{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if settings.social_twitter_link != blank -%}
      {{ settings.social_twitter_link | json }}
    {%- endif -%}
  ]
}
</script>
```

### Breadcrumb Schema
**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- unless template == 'index' -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": {{ shop.url | json }}
    }
    {%- if collection -%}
    ,{
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": {{ collection.title | json }},
      "item": {{ shop.url | append: collection.url | json }}
    }
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if product -%}
    ,{
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": {% if collection %}3{% else %}2{% endif %},
      "name": {{ product.title | json }},
      "item": {{ shop.url | append: product.url | json }}
    }
    {%- elsif page -%}
    ,{
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": {{ page.title | json }},
      "item": {{ shop.url | append: page.url | json }}
    }
    {%- endif -%}
  ]
}
</script>
{%- endunless -%}
```

## Image Optimization for SEO

### Alt Text Standards
Always provide meaningful alt text for images that convey information.

**Pattern for Product Images:**
```liquid
{{ product.featured_media | image_tag: 
  alt: product.featured_media.alt | default: product.title,
  loading: 'lazy',
  width: 800,
  height: 800
}}
```

**Pattern for Collection Images:**
```liquid
{{ collection.featured_image | image_tag: 
  alt: collection.featured_image.alt | default: collection.title | append: ' collection',
  loading: 'lazy'
}}
```

### Image File Naming
Use descriptive, keyword-rich file names for better image SEO.

**Good Examples:**
- `blue-cotton-t-shirt-front-view.jpg`
- `leather-crossbody-bag-brown.jpg`
- `organic-coffee-beans-arabica.jpg`

**Bad Examples:**
- `IMG_1234.jpg`
- `product1.jpg`
- `image.png`

## URL Structure Optimization

### Clean URL Patterns
Use descriptive URLs that include relevant keywords.

**Product URLs:**
```
/products/eco-friendly-water-bottle
/products/organic-cotton-t-shirt-blue
/products/handmade-leather-wallet
```

**Collection URLs:**
```
/collections/sustainable-clothing
/collections/kitchen-accessories
/collections/outdoor-gear
```

**Blog URLs:**
```
/blogs/news/how-to-choose-sustainable-clothing
/blogs/guides/kitchen-organization-tips
```

### Handle Optimization
Ensure handles are SEO-friendly when creating products and collections.

**Pattern in Admin:**
```liquid
{%- assign optimized_handle = product.title | handleize -%}
{%- if optimized_handle != product.handle -%}
  <!-- Consider updating handle to: {{ optimized_handle }} -->
{%- endif -%}
```

## Internal Linking Strategy

### Related Products Linking
Implement strategic internal linking for related products.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- if recommendations.products_count > 0 -%}
  <section class="related-products" aria-labelledby="related-heading">
    <h2 id="related-heading">You might also like</h2>
    <div class="product-grid">
      {%- for product in recommendations.products limit: 4 -%}
        <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="product-card" title="View {{ product.title }}">
          {{ product.featured_media | image_tag: 
            alt: product.title,
            loading: 'lazy',
            width: 300
          }}
          <h3>{{ product.title }}</h3>
          <p class="price">{{ product.price | money }}</p>
        </a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
```

### Collection Navigation
Implement breadcrumb navigation for better internal linking.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- unless template == 'index' -%}
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
  <ol>
    <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
    {%- if collection -%}
      <li><a href="{{ collection.url }}">{{ collection.title }}</a></li>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if product -%}
      <li aria-current="page">{{ product.title | truncate: 50 }}</li>
    {%- elsif page -%}
      <li aria-current="page">{{ page.title }}</li>
    {%- endif -%}
  </ol>
</nav>
{%- endunless -%}
```

## Page Speed Optimization

### Critical CSS Implementation
Inline critical CSS for above-the-fold content to improve loading speed.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
<style>
  /* Critical CSS for above-the-fold content */
  .header { /* styles */ }
  .hero-section { /* styles */ }
  .product-form { /* styles */ }
</style>

<!-- Non-critical CSS -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'theme.css' | asset_url }}" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
```

### Image Lazy Loading
Implement proper lazy loading for images below the fold.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- for product in collection.products -%}
  {{ product.featured_media | image_tag: 
    loading: 'lazy',
    alt: product.title,
    width: 400,
    height: 400
  }}
{%- endfor -%}
```

### Preload Critical Resources
Preload important resources for faster rendering.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
<!-- Preload critical fonts -->
<link rel="preload" href="{{ 'font.woff2' | asset_url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>

<!-- Preload hero image -->
{%- if section.settings.hero_image -%}
  <link rel="preload" href="{{ section.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 1920 }}" as="image">
{%- endif -%}
```

## Mobile SEO Optimization

### Viewport Meta Tag
Always include proper viewport meta tag for mobile optimization.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
```

### Mobile-First Design
Ensure responsive design with mobile-first approach.

**CSS Pattern:**
```css
/* Mobile first */
.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
}

/* Tablet and up */
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .product-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

/* Desktop */
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .product-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  }
}
```

## Content Optimization

### Product Description SEO
Write unique, detailed product descriptions with natural keyword integration.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- if product.description != blank -%}
  <div class="product-description" itemprop="description">
    {{ product.description }}
  </div>
{%- else -%}
  <div class="product-description">
    <p>{{ product.title }} - Available at {{ shop.name }}. High-quality product with fast shipping and excellent customer service.</p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
```

### Collection Description Optimization
**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- if collection.description != blank -%}
  <div class="collection-description">
    {{ collection.description }}
  </div>
{%- else -%}
  <div class="collection-description">
    <p>Shop our {{ collection.title | downcase }} collection at {{ shop.name }}. {{ collection.products_count }} products available with fast, free shipping.</p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
```

## Technical SEO Implementation

### XML Sitemap Optimization
Ensure proper sitemap generation and submission.

**Check:**
- `/sitemap.xml` is accessible
- All important pages are included
- Regular updates when content changes

### Robots.txt Optimization
Configure robots.txt for proper crawling.

**Pattern:**
```
User-agent: *
Disallow: /admin
Disallow: /cart
Disallow: /orders
Disallow: /checkouts/
Disallow: /checkout
Disallow: /carts
Disallow: /account
Allow: /

Sitemap: https://yourstore.myshopify.com/sitemap.xml
```

### Hreflang Implementation
For international stores, implement hreflang tags.

**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- if shop.enabled_currencies.size > 1 or localization.available_languages.size > 1 -%}
  {%- for language in localization.available_languages -%}
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="{{ language.iso_code }}" href="{{ canonical_url | default: request.origin }}{{ request.path }}">
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
```

## Performance Monitoring

### Core Web Vitals Optimization
Monitor and optimize for Core Web Vitals metrics.

**LCP (Largest Contentful Paint):**
- Optimize hero images with proper sizing
- Use WebP format when supported
- Implement critical CSS

**FID (First Input Delay):**
- Minimize JavaScript execution time
- Use web workers for heavy computations
- Optimize third-party scripts

**CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift):**
- Set explicit dimensions for images
- Reserve space for dynamic content
- Use CSS transforms instead of layout changes

### SEO Monitoring Implementation
**Pattern for Google Analytics:**
```liquid
{%- if settings.google_analytics_id != blank -%}
<!-- Google Analytics -->
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id={{ settings.google_analytics_id }}"></script>
<script>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
  gtag('js', new Date());
  gtag('config', '{{ settings.google_analytics_id }}');
</script>
{%- endif -%}
```

## Local SEO (for Physical Stores)

### Local Business Schema
**Pattern:**
```liquid
{%- if shop.address -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "LocalBusiness",
  "name": {{ shop.name | json }},
  "url": {{ shop.url | json }},
  "telephone": {{ shop.phone | json }},
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "streetAddress": {{ shop.address.street | json }},
    "addressLocality": {{ shop.address.city | json }},
    "addressRegion": {{ shop.address.province | json }},
    "postalCode": {{ shop.address.zip | json }},
    "addressCountry": {{ shop.address.country | json }}
  }
}
</script>
{%- endif -%}
```

## Error Prevention and Validation

### Common SEO Pitfalls to Avoid

**❌ Don't:**
- Use duplicate meta descriptions across pages
- Leave alt text empty for content images
- Create thin or duplicate content
- Use generic page titles
- Ignore mobile optimization
- Block important pages in robots.txt
- Use non-descriptive URLs

**✅ Do:**
- Create unique content for each page
- Implement proper heading hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)
- Use semantic HTML structure
- Optimize for page speed
- Implement structured data
- Monitor search console regularly
- Test mobile usability

### SEO Validation Checklist

**On-Page Elements:**
- [ ] Unique title tags under 60 characters
- [ ] Meta descriptions under 160 characters
- [ ] H1 tag present and unique
- [ ] Proper heading hierarchy
- [ ] Alt text for all content images
- [ ] Clean, descriptive URLs
- [ ] Internal linking implemented

**Technical SEO:**
- [ ] Canonical URLs implemented
- [ ] XML sitemap accessible
- [ ] Robots.txt configured
- [ ] Page speed optimized
- [ ] Mobile-friendly design
- [ ] Structured data implemented
- [ ] HTTPS enabled

**Content Quality:**
- [ ] Unique product descriptions
- [ ] Relevant keyword usage
- [ ] Proper content length
- [ ] Related content linking
- [ ] Fresh, updated content

## Testing and Monitoring Tools

### Essential SEO Tools
- **Google Search Console**: Monitor search performance
- **Google PageSpeed Insights**: Test page speed
- **Rich Results Test**: Validate structured data
- **Mobile-Friendly Test**: Check mobile optimization
- **Lighthouse**: Comprehensive performance audit

### Regular SEO Audits
Conduct monthly SEO audits checking:
- Page speed performance
- Broken links and 404 errors
- Missing meta tags
- Duplicate content issues
- Image optimization status
- Mobile usability problems

**Check in:** All template files, especially `layout/theme.liquid`, `templates/*.liquid`, and section files.